      "species": "lizardfolk",
      "persona": "Plain-spoken, tired of policy talk, not looking for a fight.",
      "secret": "Worried the sea routes are getting harder for ordinary people, not because merfolk started it.",
      "could_know": "Sits at Dragon's Brew on Mondays with her riverfolk friend; hears ferry and sea-region news",
      "opener": "Morning. We're just talking ferries \u2014 nothing dramatic.",
      "movement": "idle",
      "tint": "#3f8f5a",
      "wants_item": "",
      "reveal_beat": "sea_talk",
      "scripted_lines": [
